"content.set.mistwillow":`Mistwillow`,"content.set.rainwhisper":`Rainwhisper`,"content.set.starweave":`Starweave`,"content.set.swallowcall":`Swallowcall`,"content.set.swayingHeights":`Swaying Heights`,"content.set.swiftGale":`Swift Gale`,"content.set.tiltrim":`Tiltrim`,"content.setFourPiece.cleftpeak":`Boss hit: +1% DMG/stack x5; +8% Varied Combo at 5 stacks`,"content.setFourPiece.cloudshear":`Attack Buff effects also grant +2% DMG and healing, 6% on self`,"content.setFourPiece.etherwrath":`Boss hit: +1.2% all Atk/stack x5; +6 Pen on MA effects`,"content.setFourPiece.hawkwing":`Affinity hit: +1.8% Phys/Bellstrike Atk per stack, 5s, x5`,"content.setFourPiece.ivorybloom":`Full HP/after crit heal: +5% Crit Rate, +15% Crit DMG`,"content.setFourPiece.jadeware":`MA Skill: +10% Affinity DMG, +7.5% Direct Aff. vs low Qi`,"content.setFourPiece.mistwillow":`Light/Heavy cross-boost +10% Phys & Silkbind DMG, 15s`,"content.setFourPiece.rainwhisper":`+10% Crit DMG; +15% more with a self-applied shield`,"content.setFourPiece.starweave":`Boss/multi hit: +3% MA Skill DMG/stack x5, more at range`,"content.setFourPiece.swallowcall":`Light Attack +12% DMG; +6% Phys/Bamboocut vs low Qi`,"content.setFourPiece.swayingHeights":`+5% DMG vs targets above 50% HP, up to +10%`,"content.setFourPiece.swiftGale":`+10% Airborne Heavy Attack DMG, knockdown every 10s`,"content.setFourPiece.tiltrim":`Hit while enhanced: +1% all Atk/stack x5; +5% Inebriate`,"content.setFourPieceFull.cleftpeak":`Hitting a boss or player grants Shattered Ridge for 5 seconds: Increases HP damage dealt by 1%, stacking up to 5 times. At 5 stacks, increases damage of Light/Heavy Attack: Varied Combo, Assist Trigger Skills, and their assist effects by a further 8%. A successful Deflect immediately grants 5 stacks of Shattered Ridge.
The extra DMG Boost applies to the following skills: Light/Heavy Attack: Varied Combo of Snowparting Blade, Thundercry Blade, Vernal Umbrella, Museflow Waist Drum, and Willowbend Fan; Inkwell Fan: Moon Shatter Spring; Anxi Army Assist and its Trigger Skills of Snowparting Blade and Phalanxbane Blade.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.cloudshear":`When you successfully apply an Attack Buff Effect to the target, you also apply Cloudshear, increasing all damage and healing bonuses by 2% for up to 15 seconds. If the target is yourself, the effect is replaced with Cloudshear: Wings, increasing the bonus to 6%.
Applicable Attack Buff Effects include: Museflow Waist Drum: Radiant, Willowbend Fan: Rustling, Soulshade Umbrella: DMG Boost and DMG Boost: Deluge.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.etherwrath":`Hitting a boss or player grants Etherwrath: Increases all types of Attack by 1.2% (including Physical Attack and all Attribute Attacks) for 8s, stacking up to 5 times. At 5 stacks of Etherwrath, grants 6 additional Penetration of all types when Martial Art effects deal damage. Triggering a Perfect Dodge instantly grants 5 stacks of Etherwrath.
Applicable Martial Art effects: Heavenwill Gauntlets - Falcon's Pursuit and Vile Condemned series, Skystrike Gauntlets - Falcon's Pursuit, Mortal Rope Dart - Rodent, Everspring Umbrella - Resonance, Phalanxbane Blade - Anxi Army Assist.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.hawkwing":`When any damage triggers Affinity, gain Hawkwing: increases both Physical Attack and Bellstrike Attack by 1.8% for 5 seconds, stacking up to 5 times.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.ivorybloom":`At Max HP or within 3 seconds of a Critical Healing, there is a bonus 5% chance to deal Critical Healing and Critical DMG, and the effects of Critical Healing and Critical DMG are increased by 15%.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.jadeware":`Casting Martial Art Skill activates Jadeware effect: Increases Affinity DMG by 10% and increases Direct Affinity Rate by 7.5% against targets in Qi Imbalance or with a Qi percentage lower than yours or below 40%. This effect lasts 10s and can only trigger once every 12s.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.mistwillow":`Landing a Heavy Attack/Heavy Attack Charged Skill increases the Physical and Silkbind damage of Light Attacks and Ballistic Skills by 10% for 15 seconds, and vice versa. When both damage bonuses exist at the same time, they will be upgraded to Mistwillow: increases the Physical and Silkbind damage of both Light Attack/Ballistic Skills and Heavy Attack/Heavy Attack Charged Skills. Hitting the enemy with corresponding skills again can refresh the effect's duration.
The duration of the effects above can only be refreshed once every 2 seconds.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.rainwhisper":`Increases all Critical DMG and healing by 10%, and further increases them by 15% when you have an HP shield applied by yourself.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.starweave":`When hitting at least 2 enemies simultaneously, or hitting a boss or player, you gain 1 stack of Starweave: For 5 seconds, Martial Art Skills deal 3% increased damage and further bonus damage to enemies more than 4 meters away; the bonus increases with distance, up to 1% at 8 meters. Starweave stacks up to 5 times, and 1 stack is removed each time you take damage. Up to 2 stacks of Starweave can be gained per second.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.swallowcall":`Light Attacks and effects triggered by Light Attacks (e.g., rodents) deal 12% more HP damage, and deal 6% more Physical and Bamboocut damage to targets with below 40% Qi or suffering from a Qi Anomaly status (including Vacant Peak, Bone Corrosion, and Qi Imbalance).`,"content.setFourPieceFull.swayingHeights":`Increases the damage dealt against targets with more than 50% HP by 5%. Every 5% more HP further increases this bonus by 1%, up to 10%.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.swiftGale":`Increases Airborne Heavy Attack by 10% and knocks the target. The Knocked-Down effect can only trigger once every 10 seconds.`,"content.setFourPieceFull.tiltrim":`Dealing damage while under a Martial Art Special Enhancement grants Tiltrim for 5s. Each stack of Tiltrim increases all attacks by 1%, including Physical Attack and all Attribute Attacks. At 5 stacks, Inebriate-enhanced skills deal an additional 5% HP damage.
Applicable Enhancements: Inebriate, Infernal Twinblades - Flamelash, Everspring Umbrella - Flower Burial.`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-bitter-season-tick":`Bitter Season Tick`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-blade-against-waves":`Twinblade Light Attack - Blade Against Waves`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-blade-against-waves.breakdown":`Blade Against Waves`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-blade-vessel":`Twinblade Heavy Attack (outside Tipsy)`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-blade-vessel.breakdown":`Blade Vessel`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-bloombreak":`Gauntlet Light Attack - Inebriate`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-bloombreak.breakdown":`Bloombreak`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-boundvessel":`Twinblade Heavy Attack`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-boundvessel-drink-cancel":`Twinblade Heavy Attack [drink cancel]`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-boundvessel-drink-cancel.breakdown":`Boundvessel`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-boundvessel.breakdown":`Boundvessel`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-castlink":`Castlink`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-castlink.variant.hv-castlink-jadeflush":`Jadeflush`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-deflect-cancel":`Deflect Cancel`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-deflect-cancel-prepull":`Deflect Cancel Prepull`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-delay":`Delay`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-dragonquench-inebriate":`Dragonquench - Inebriate`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-dragonquench-inebriate-cancel":`Dragonquench - Inebriate [cancel]`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-dragonquench-inebriate-cancel.breakdown":`Dragonquench - Inebriate`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-dragonquench-inebriate-second":`Dragonquench - Inebriate (2nd combo)`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-dragonquench-inebriate-second-cancel":`Dragonquench - Inebriate (2nd combo) [cancel]`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-dragonquench-inebriate-second-cancel.breakdown":`Dragonquench - Inebriate`,"content.skill.bamboocutDraught-dragonquench-inebriate-second.breakdown"